  "scope": "For the 3 by 3 Birkhoff polytope with the Frobenius norm, minimizing over every nonempty proper face G as defined in source.md, Phi(B_3)=1/sqrt(2). The minimizing faces are exactly one orbit under the specified group generated by independent row and column permutations and transposition: the six edges whose two permutation vertices have relative permutation a 3-cycle, represented by conv{P_123,P_231}.",
